    <pubDate>Wed, 19 Mar 2025 14:43:04 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>🎙️嘉宾：</span></p><span></span><ul><span>  </span><li><span>👨胡涛：陶瓷艺术家 【</span><a href="https://www.xiaohongshu.com/user/profile/5bcb414fa8bb6f000129e933?xsec_token=YBVre86QV9a3DHFw0cjaniRV-7OOL74oaU9XKg8SmOveA=&amp;xsec_source=app_share&amp;xhsshare=WeixinSession&amp;appuid=5bcb414fa8bb6f000129e933&amp;apptime=1742525246&amp;share_id=091233add458478bbace385f12608fac&amp;share_channel=wechat&amp;wechatWid=779a78fc14a8930602d96c28e458fcbb&amp;wechatOrigin=menu" data-url="https://www.xiaohongshu.com/user/profile/5bcb414fa8bb6f000129e933?xsec_token=YBVre86QV9a3DHFw0cjaniRV-7OOL74oaU9XKg8SmOveA=&amp;xsec_source=app_share&amp;xhsshare=WeixinSession&amp;appuid=5bcb414fa8bb6f000129e933&amp;apptime=1742525246&amp;share_id=091233add458478bbace385f12608fac&amp;share_channel=wechat&amp;wechatWid=779a78fc14a8930602d96c28e458fcbb&amp;wechatOrigin=menu"><span>小红书</span></a><span>】</span></li><span>  </span><li><span>👩尉尉：陶瓷艺术家</span></li><span></span></ul><span></span><p><span>🎙️主持人：</span></p><span></span><ul><span>  </span><li><span>👨老张：大龄在职程序员，来自东北的i人，热爱各种稀奇古怪的东西</span></li><span>  </span><li><span>👨许安：非典型程序员</span></li><span></span></ul><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="0">00:00</a> 开始</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="123">02:03</a> 嘉宾介绍</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="177">02:57</a> 陶瓷制作过程</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="551">09:11</a> 陶瓷彩绘</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="843">14:03</a> 纯手工和良品率的问题</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1041">17:21</a> 手工量产</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1338">22:18</a> 陶瓷制品</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1483">24:43</a> 价格构成要素，工作量&amp;品牌</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1744">29:04</a> 研发</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1824">30:24</a> 关于陶瓷销售</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2183">36:23</a> 关于作品</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2552">42:32</a> 销售周期</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2620">43:40</a> 进入行业</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2738">45:38</a> 陶瓷的“土壤”，非景德镇不可</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2955">49:15</a> 科技与狠活</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3253">54:13</a> 新手建议</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3578">59:38</a> 结尾《青花瓷》by 周杰伦</span></p><span></span><p><span>感谢收听</span></p><span></span><h2><span>《江湖龙套》简介：</span></h2><span></span><p><span>我们每一期都会邀请不同行业的嘉宾和我们一起来聊一聊他的工作和生活，我们以一个观察者的视角来探查别人的生活状态和工作状态。我们希望这个节目可以让你更多的感受不同行业和不同职业的人们每天都在做些什么。还有他们对生活的态度，对人生的态度，对梦想的态度。</span></p>]]></description>
