  <item>
    <title>No.11 医务工作者-中医 @上海</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/67d0f162e924d4525afc57b3</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">67d0f162e924d4525afc57b3</guid>
    <pubDate>Wed, 12 Mar 2025 02:46:18 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>🎙️嘉宾：</span></p><span></span><ul><span>  </span><li><span>👨雨老师：社区医院中医</span></li><span>  </span><li><span>👩C老师：社区医院中医</span></li><span></span></ul><span></span><p><span>🎙️主持人：</span></p><span></span><ul><span>  </span><li><span>👨老张：大龄在职程序员，来自东北的i人，热爱各种稀奇古怪的东西</span></li><span>  </span><li><span>👩Jessica：</span><a href="https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/podcast/66226a9cf33b89069c3be218" data-url="https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/podcast/66226a9cf33b89069c3be218"><span>《失控一点》</span></a><span>主播，INFP，10年+互联网产品经理，善良的人性观察者，你生活的好朋友，一个常年喜欢写文字、旅游、摄影的文艺青年</span></li><span></span></ul><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="0">00:00</a> 开始</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="44">00:44</a> 日常工作</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="372">06:12</a> 诊疗逻辑</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="492">08:12</a> 中西医的逻辑对比</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="719">11:59</a> 在经验如此重要的工作中，AI是否会有更多优势</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="965">16:05</a> 关于各种不同的患者</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1032">17:12</a> 脉相</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1198">19:58</a> 关于对中医的疑问</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1463">24:23</a> 行业问题和困境以及关于“医生要自掏腰包给病人看病”这件事</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2009">33:29</a> 关于患者的知情【权利】和【能力】</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2265">37:45</a> 医生推荐的看病方式</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2306">38:26</a> 科普中医常见专业术语</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2625">43:45</a> 中西医矛盾，以及如何选择</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2759">45:59</a> 现代科技对中医的影响</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2863">47:43</a> 关于针灸</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3082">51:22</a> 天书病例和药方</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3232">53:52</a> 为什么学中医</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3462">57:42</a> 面对急重症病人的心态</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="4058">01:07:38</a> 未来的理想状态</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="4331">01:12:11</a> 成就感</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="4397">01:13:17</a> 关于社区医院</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="4794">01:19:54</a> 收入问题</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="4999">01:23:19</a> 入行建议</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="5287">01:28:07</a> 片尾《本草纲目》by 周杰伦</span></p><span></span><p><span>感谢收听</span></p><span></span><h2><span>《江湖龙套》简介：</span></h2><span></span><p><span>我们每一期都会邀请不同行业的嘉宾和我们一起来聊一聊他的工作和生活，我们以一个观察者的视角来探查别人的生活状态和工作状态。我们希望这个节目可以让你更多的感受不同行业和不同职业的人们每天都在做些什么。还有他们对生活的态度，对人生的态度，对梦想的态度。</span></p>]]></description>
