    <pubDate>Tue, 04 Mar 2025 13:12:35 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>知而不言，言而无信</span></p><span></span><p><span>🎙️嘉宾：</span></p><span></span><ul><span>  </span><li><span>👨王知无：电影区UP主 商业合作请联系VX：13311286278</span></li><span></span></ul><span></span><p><span>🎙️主持人：</span></p><span></span><ul><span>  </span><li><span>👨老张：大龄在职程序员，来自东北的i人，热爱各种稀奇古怪的东西</span></li><span>  </span><li><span>👩小乔：E人化妆师，美甲师</span></li><span></span></ul><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="0">00:00</a> 开始</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="35">00:35</a> 嘉宾介绍</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="81">01:21</a> UP主的懒散悠闲的工作</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="249">04:09</a> 如何开始</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="749">12:29</a> UP主有哪些赚钱的方式，说来说去还是广告</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1348">22:28</a> 个人创作者vs团队创作者</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1691">28:11</a> 观众性别倾向</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2602">43:22</a> 如何获取流量 --- 没什么好办法</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2799">46:39</a> 版权风暴</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3093">51:33</a> 网剧&amp;短视频的讨论，和普通视频并不是一个赛道</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3687">01:01:27</a> 入行建议</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3780">01:03:00</a> 结尾《</span><a href="https://www.bilibili.com/video/BV1Jg4y1b7Uv/?spm_id_from=333.337.search-card.all.click&amp;vd_source=a800cf1c9f382eafe1db27b091606c7a" data-url="https://www.bilibili.com/video/BV1Jg4y1b7Uv/?spm_id_from=333.337.search-card.all.click&amp;vd_source=a800cf1c9f382eafe1db27b091606c7a"><span>香港电影竟如此丧心病狂</span></a><span>》片段 by 王知无</span></p><span></span><p><span>感谢收听</span></p><span></span><h2><span>《江湖龙套》简介：</span></h2><span></span><p><span>我们每一期都会邀请不同行业的嘉宾和我们一起来聊一聊他的工作和生活，我们以一个观察者的视角来探查别人的生活状态和工作状态。我们希望这个节目可以让你更多的感受不同行业和不同职业的人们每天都在做些什么。还有他们对生活的态度，对人生的态度，对梦想的态度。</span></p>]]></description>
